125|finding 1 means the busy gate's safety still rests on caller discipline,
126|not on the extracted primitive, until the return value is honored.","final_result":true,"kind":"output","task_id":"01a182f7-95c8-7320-afa4-72daa2cb497a"},"kind":"task_lifecycle","run_stream":{"id":"01a182f7-8dd3-7423-be97-952c191b33e7","kind":"run"},"task_id":"01a182f7-95c8-7320-afa4-72daa2cb497a","task_stream":{"id":"01a182f7-95c8-7320-afa4-72daa2cb497a","kind":"task"}}}
