1|# Review 32: pictures placement
2|
3|Source: docs/tasks/32-pictures-placement.md and agent-logs/prompts/32-impl.md
4|(architecture review 5, candidates 1 and 2). Hard requirement: user-visible
5|behavior identical (same DOM, classes, copy, request bodies, timing, same
6|request ordering).
7|
8|What this change does: figure placement (`groupFiguresByEndN`,
9|`figuresAfter`, `pageOfOrdinal`) and the request gates (`tryStart`/`finish`,
10|`canStart`, `canRetryFigure`, `canIllustrateScene`) move into pure
11|`app/folio/figure-placement.ts`, used by `scene-page.tsx` and
12|`use-pictures.ts`; `pref` becomes a hook argument read through a ref; the
13|lightbox trio becomes `lightbox: { item, open, close }`; the icon and strings
